{"abstract":[{"text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or delivered: event by event, or a whole group of events, such as a session, at once.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/events(of:rate:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/events(where:rate:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/grouped(by:where:rate:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Type Methods","anchor":"Type-Methods"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRate","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRateKey","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/InvalidSampleRate"],"generated":true,"title":"Sampling","anchor":"Sampling"}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracker built with samplers runs them on its worker, after its enrichers, so a sampler sees","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"what they set:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let tracker = Tracker(samplers: [","    .events(of: Scrolled.self, rate: 0.1),","    .events(where: { $0.consentCategory == .performance }, rate: 0.5),","])"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each sampler decides on its own, and a record is kept only if every sampler that applies to it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps it. A kept record carries the product of their rates as its "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRateKey",